              "text": "ಅಜ್ಜ ಯಾವಾಗಲೂ ಗತಕಾಲದ ವೈಭವದ ಬಗ್ಗೆ ಮಾತಾಡುತ್ತಾರೆ. ajja yāvāgalū gatakālada vaibhavada bagge mātāḍuttāre. Grandfather always talks about the glory of the past."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಗತ, gone, and ಕಾಲ, time."
